Icons in this folder are from Lucide (https://lucide.dev), lucide-static v0.460.0,
recoloured with Psanctuary's teal strokes (#0d9488, #0f766e) so they read in both GitHub themes. octagon.svg (for ORG) and
status-next.svg, status-partly.svg and status-wait.svg are drawn for the fleet in the same style.

